  "details": "In live VRChat 1275, i noticed very odd bug.\n\nWhen you open the ingame chat function, you will see the keyboard has extra parts enabled, but they're clearly not for chat function. They're for world or user search.\n\nIt even overlap the character counter, so i am sure the part for search should disabled.\n\nSee screenshot for the bug. I think it's forgotten to turn the search layer off.",
